  "summary": "A temporary art form using sand to create intricate designs that accompany oral storytelling traditions.",
  "description": "Created by hand using colored sands, these temporary designs feature geometric patterns and symbolic representations of Dreaming stories. Used in ceremonies, teaching, and cultural transmission, the sand paintings are erased after completion, reflecting the ephemeral nature of the stories they illustrate.",
